% formalizes: def:fine
% definition: Fine
% says: A fixed amount per day that an overdue loan adds to its member's account.
% fidelity: strained — "a fixed amount per day" is arithmetic over days; only that a fine accrues, and to whom, is stated.
fine_accrues(L) :- overdue(L).
owes_fine(M, L) :- fine_accrues(L), loan_member(L, M).
